@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle -> [*] : logout
Idle --> CreatingTask : create task
CreatingTask --> Idle : task created
Idle --> SettingReminder : set reminder
SettingReminder --> Idle : reminder set
Idle --> ViewingPlan : view time management plan
ViewingPlan --> Idle : plan reviewed
Idle --> ViewingSuggestions : access suggestions
ViewingSuggestions --> Idle : suggestions reviewed
@enduml
